# Render with: bash doc/record-example.sh cellbuffer
Output doc/examples/cellbuffer.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 560
Set Height 240
Set Padding 6
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 22
Set WaitTimeout 180s

Hide
Type "bash doc/run-examples.sh cellbuffer"
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
Show

Sleep 3500ms

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
